  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Impossible spells can be applied to any magic effect which allows a Will save. Creatures that fail their Will saving throw against the effect take 1d3 strain damage. This die sizes increases by 1 (1d3-&gt;1d4-&gt;1d6-&gt;1d8-&gt;1d10-&gt;2d6) for every 4 caster levels you possess.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +1 spell point</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This spell uses the strain system introduced in <em>Horror Adventures</em> and expanded upon in <em>The Cataclysm Handbook</em> and <em>The Aberration Bestiary</em>. Games that do not use this system should not incorporate this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
